  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3302.10 “Imminent safety hazard” means non-compliance that presents an immediate and unreasonable risk of death or severe personal injury.\n\nSource. #9752, eff 7-9-10; ss by #9752, eff 7-9-10 (formerly Saf-C 3302.11); ss by #12737, eff 3-8-19",
